# Scroll area

Scroll area keeps native wheel, touch, and keyboard scrolling while offering custom tracks and draggable thumbs. Set its height in the surrounding layout. Use `type="hover"` (default), `scroll`, `auto`, or `always` to control visibility; `scrollbarSize`, `scrollbarClass`, and `thumbClass` customize the tracks. Bind `viewportRef` only when you need direct access to the scrolling element.

